{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>社評摘要｜AM730：電梯門再揭官僚推責／明報：推廣「無處不旅遊」地區諮詢要做好</strong></p><p>・社評聚焦電梯門責任問題<br>・關注官僚互相推責<br>・建議旅遊地區諮詢<br>・推廣無處不旅遊</p><p>暫時未能從TVB 新聞擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202086-社評摘要AM730電梯門再揭官僚推責明報推廣無處不旅遊地區諮詢要做好\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T18:20:36.637757+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T22:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T03:57:59.892074+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T18:17:59.729696+00:00","content_hash":"07638fda3a9d34ba4b2ef056e0152b30f0aaccfd69397cf2ad1867b4ac929af1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}